    "teach_4": {
      "id": "teach_4",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "This explains a neat comparison.\n\nA cyclist rides both ways at 12 km/hr.\nA boat moves at 10 km/hr in still water with current 4, so its river speeds are 14 and 6.",
