      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Boat round-trip average:\n2×14×6/(14+6) = 168/20 = 8.4 km/hr.\n\nThe cyclist averages 12 km/hr, so the cyclist returns first over the same out-and-back distance.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
